    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Question 3 · Standard ready\n\nCount valid requests whose delivery is STANDARD. The three calculated queue counts should add up to 30.\n\n**Your work area:** add native validation/routing and **Summarize → Count `request_id`**.\n\nMap the calculated field directly to **Stage 3 answer → b3** as **Number**. Keep enabled forward paths from Request rows through your calculation to this answer. The Check node is optional.\n\n**Build your calculation in the space below.**",
